The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository.

Data redistributed here is covered by its own licence, not by the MIT terms:

  assets/_shared/panel61/_shared/data/{train,val}.npy
      80,463 x 61 and 10,057 x 61 integer count matrices, an endothelial
      61-gene panel derived from the Heart Cell Atlas
      (Litvinukova et al., Nature 2020, https://www.heartcellatlas.org),
      which is distributed under CC-BY-4.0. These two arrays remain under
      CC-BY-4.0; attribute the original authors when you redistribute them.

Third-party software is not vendored here. scVI and scANVI are used through
scvi-tools, and CFGen through its own upstream repository; baselines/README.md
records the version and commit of each, and what was and was not changed.
